  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc5/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review @100b6fbb6e: the declarations now read stableid-v13 / shapeid-v3 / repofp-v2 / symbol-fp-v2. Emitted values: stable_id sha256:<16hex>, shape_id sha256:<16hex>, repo_fingerprint sha256:<64hex> (config_fingerprint and run_signature also sha256:); fingerprint hgfp2:. No hgstableid/hgshapeid/hgrepofp prefix exists in src. The collision complaint holds. Stale parts: the owner plan's 'v9 = relabel, v10 = bitbake' numbering was used up by WI-tusad (v9) and WI-banod (v10), so the relabel is now v14 and the prefixes need new numbers. The undeclared-SCIP-scheme concern from 2026-09-18 is now declared: v11 (INV-kutid) names scip_stable_id in the spec history. MECHANISM: identity values carry an algorithm prefix (sha256:) rather than a per-scheme, versioned prefix, so three or more identity fields share one value grammar. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-vuvah, INV-pamum, WI-marok."  # 4a97
